  lines:
  - english: Some say the lake keeps words that people never got to say.
    vietnamese: "C\xF3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1EA3o h\u1ED3 gi\u1EEF nh\u1EEFng l\u1EDDi
      ch\u01B0a k\u1ECBp n\xF3i."
  - english: Perhaps the Error Dust carries forgotten words. I wonder what it remembers.
    vietnamese: "C\xF3 l\u1EBD B\u1EE5i L\u1ED7i mang theo nh\u1EEFng t\u1EEB b\u1ECB
      b\u1ECF qu\xEAn. B\xE0 t\u1EF1 h\u1ECFi ch\xFAng c\xF2n nh\u1EDB \u0111i\u1EC1u
      g\xEC."
